OL,3,GNEWSAWhy one of sport's most iconic
OL,4,Aimages resonates 70 years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dramatic sporting moment frozen in
OL,7,Ftime 70 years ago remains as popular as
OL,8,Fever with football fans, and even
OL,9,Finspired a statue.
OL,11,FOne of the finest players of his era -
OL,12,FTom Finney of Preston North End - was
OL,13,Fphotographed during a deluge at
OL,14,FChelsea's Stamford Bridge in August
OL,15,F1956.
OL,17,FLike a water-skier cutting through the
OL,18,Fwake of a speedboat, Finney somehow
OL,19,Fmanages to stay upright and in control.
